<v Scott Froehlich>是的。

00:32:29.060 --> 00:32:34.630
<v Ira Glass>That's right. They accidentally sold the same car twice to two different customers.
<v Ira Glass>没错。他们不小心把同一辆车卖给了两个不同的客户。

00:32:34.630 --> 00:33:03.520
<v Ira Glass>Here's how it happened. Scott had sold a red Jeep Grand Cherokee to this customer, this guy who came in with his dad. They left a deposit. But another salesman, Mike Lester-- everybody calls him Mike L-- had already sold that same car the day before. The customer hadn't picked up the car yet. And the little magnetic chip that they use to keep track of the sales, the one for this car, nobody had put it on the whiteboard in Freddie's office, the board that keeps track of who sold what. Scott is not happy.
<v Ira Glass>事情是这样发生的。斯科蒂把一辆红色Jeep大切诺基卖给了这个客户，那个和他父亲一起来的家伙。他们留下了押金。但另一个销售员，迈克·莱斯特——大家都叫他迈克·L——在前一天已经卖掉了那辆车。客户还没来提车。他们用来追踪销售的小磁筹码，那辆车的筹码，没人把它放在弗雷迪办公室的白板上，那块记录谁卖了什么的板子上。斯科蒂很不高兴。

00:33:03.520 --> 00:33:07.290
<v Scott Froehlich>I want a drink. You're welcome to come over for a fucking drink.
<v Scott Froehlich>我想喝一杯。欢迎过来喝一杯。

00:33:07.290 --> 00:33:10.640
<v Ira Glass>Or maybe this does a better job capturing his mood.
<v Ira Glass>或者也许这能更好地捕捉他的情绪。

00:33:10.640 --> 00:33:13.800
<v Scott Froehlich>God, I want to shoot myself right now.
<v Scott Froehlich>天哪，我现在想自杀。

00:33:13.800 --> 00:33:31.250
<v Ira Glass>An hour later, the customer is back on the lot with his dad, and Scott walks up to him. And maybe this is the time to tell you that Scott moonlights as a mortician, which means he's used to handling all kinds of situations with customers. And so even though he did absolutely nothing wrong, here's what he says.
<v Ira Glass>一个小时后，客户和他父亲回到了店里，斯科蒂向他走去。也许现在是时候告诉你，斯科蒂在兼职做殡葬承办人，这意味着他习惯处理各种与客户的情况。所以即使他绝对没做错任何事，这就是他说的话。

00:33:31.250 --> 00:33:34.170
<v Scott Froehlich>I fucked up and I sold a sold car.
<v Scott Froehlich>我搞砸了，我卖了一辆已经卖出的车。

00:33:34.170 --> 00:33:34.510
<v Scott Froehlich>[LAUGHTER]
<v Scott Froehlich>[笑声]

00:33:34.510 --> 00:33:35.030
<v Scott Froehlich>I'll admit it.
<v Scott Froehlich>我承认。

00:33:35.030 --> 00:33:37.650
<v Customer>Broke my heart, Fredo. Broke my heart.
<v Customer>心都碎了，弗雷多。心都碎了。

