<v Ira Glass>Hope you got the customer's Godfather reference there.
<v Ira Glass>希望你听懂了客户对《教父》的引用。

00:33:41.590 --> 00:33:55.700
<v Ira Glass>Scott tells him that if the other sale falls through, the car is his. But the other deal does not fall through, so Scott and the guy go wandering around the lot in the dark, looking for another Grand Cherokee-- red. The guy is set on red. And they find one.
