00:33:55.700 --> 00:33:56.750
<v Scott Froehlich>What is this one?
<v Scott Froehlich>这一辆是什么？

00:33:56.750 --> 00:34:22.440
<v Ira Glass>Yes, it is another red Grand Cherokee. Scott writes down the stock number, runs to the desk to check it out, and it has also been sold. Scott's only hope is that that deal will fall apart and he can sell the car to this customer, who he sends home. Fingers crossed.
<v Ira Glass>是的，这是另一辆红色大切诺基。斯科蒂记下库存编号，跑到服务台去查，结果它也卖掉了。斯科蒂唯一的希望是那笔交易会搞砸，他可以把车卖给这位他已经送回家的客户。祈祷吧。

