00:34:32.310 --> 00:34:40.790
<v Sal Lanzilotta>The amount of stupidity that just happened far exceeds anything I have ever experienced in the car business.
<v Sal Lanzilotta>刚才发生的愚蠢行为远超我在汽车行业经历过的任何事情。

