<v Ira Glass>OK, here's the short version. Stephen Brown, a computer engineer from New Jersey, has come in to finalize a deal on a new Dodge Challenger coupe. Sal greets him.
<v Ira Glass>好的，简短版本。来自新泽西的计算机工程师斯蒂芬·布朗进来敲定一辆新道奇挑战者轿跑车的交易。萨尔迎接他。

