<v Stephen Brown>I'm all right.
<v Stephen Brown>我很好。

00:34:51.130 --> 00:35:00.260
<v Ira Glass>Stephen is Lori's customer, the one woman on the sales team. But Lori is out sick. Stephen tells Sal that she texted him that somebody else was going to be taking care of the deal.
