00:35:20.660 --> 00:35:40.680
<v Ira Glass>Sal pages Scotty, but he's not around. Peter's around, but he's working another deal. Then, you know how in every shop of every kind everywhere there is that one team-playing, late-staying, extra go-gettery kid you can turn to who will always help clean up whatever weirdo mess just erupted one hour before closing? Yeah. In this case, that would happen to be--
<v Ira Glass>萨尔传呼斯科蒂，但他不在。彼得在，但他正在处理另一笔交易。然后，你知道无论在哪里的任何商店，总会有那种你可以求助的、有团队精神、留到最后、额外积极的家伙，无论什么时候，一小时前刚爆发的奇怪混乱，他总能帮忙清理？是的。在这种情况下，那恰好是——

00:35:40.680 --> 00:35:42.280
<v Sal Lanzilotta>Jason, what are you doing right now?
<v Sal Lanzilotta>杰森，你现在在干什么？

00:35:42.280 --> 00:35:48.010
<v Ira Glass>Jason comes over to the podium. Sean Cole, who is trailing Jason, picks up the story from here.
<v Ira Glass>杰森来到讲台。正在跟随杰森的肖恩·科尔从这里接过了故事。

00:35:48.010 --> 00:35:51.890
<v Sean Cole>So Jason comes over to the desk, and Sal explains what's going on.
<v Sean Cole>所以杰森来到服务台，萨尔解释了正在发生的事情。

