<v Jason Mascia>Good. I'm Jason.
<v Jason Mascia>好。我是杰森。

00:36:20.640 --> 00:36:28.240
<v Sean Cole>Now, this isn't a situation where Stephen just needs to sign some papers and pick up the keys to his new car. There are still a lot of steps to march through.
<v Sean Cole>现在，这不是斯蒂芬只需要签些文件拿走新车钥匙的情况。还有很多步骤要走。

